{"id":"4431452","name":"Drake Maye","team":"NE","pos":"QB","grp":"QB","num":"10","head":"https://a.espncdn.com/i/headshots/nfl/players/full/4431452.png","age":24,"exp":"3","college":"North Carolina","draft":["2024","1","3"],"depth":{"pos":"QB","rank":1,"unit":"3WR 1TE","team":"NE"},"inj":{"status":"Active","note":"Maye's final line was one that could have easily been generated in victory, but the 2024 first-round pick couldn't quite help the Patriots keep pace with the high-powered Bears offense. Nevertheless, he was able to post his second 300-yard effort in the last three games, while also tossing multiple touchdowns for the fourth straight contest. Maye connected with Rhamondre Stevenson and Eli Raridon from 48 and 30 yards, respectively, for those two scoring strikes, the former coming off a screen pass on the last snap of the first half. Those big plays were preceded by Maye's seven-yard scoring run early in the second quarter, and he also pulled his season completion rate up to 65.9 percent with Thursday's highly efficient effort. The third-year signal-caller should have a good opportunity to stay hot in a Week 8 road matchup against the Dolphins on Sunday, Nov. 1.","date":"2026-10-23T03:42Z","detail":""},"next":{"opp":"MIA","home":false,"date":"2026-11-01T21:25Z"},"dvp":{"r":27,"td":2.5,"yds":244.3,"n":32,"g":6},"news":[{"h":"Caleb Williams throws 2 TD passes as the Bears beat Drake Maye and the Patriots 30-24","d":"\u2014 Round 2 went to Caleb Williams and the Chicago Bears.","t":"2026-10-23T05:40:08Z"},{"h":"It's Drake Maye versus Caleb Williams as the New England Patriots visit the Chicago Bears","d":"\u2014 Caleb Williams and Drake Maye have known each other for years. They were part of the same draft class, and they grew up going to the same football camps.","t":"2026-10-21T18:37:11Z"},{"h":"Drake Maye's 3 TD passes help Patriots stave off late push by Jets in 26-19 win","d":"\u2014 The mantra in New England's locker room under Mike Vrabel has been to ne